<div class="atlas-page categories-page">
  <header class="orbital-page-heading" data-reveal><div><p>Orbital Atlas / Categories</p><h1>Categories</h1><span>관심 있는 분야의 실제 기록을 목적지별로 탐색할 수 있습니다.</span></div><div class="heading-crystal" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 360 180"><ellipse cx="180" cy="90" rx="155" ry="63"/><ellipse cx="180" cy="90" rx="105" ry="40"/></svg><img src="/assets/images/atlas/atlas-crystal-v20261125.webp" alt="" width="720" height="720"></div></header>
  <ol class="topic-directory" data-reveal>
    {% for category in topics %}{% set categoryPosts = collections.posts | inCategory(category.name) %}{% set eagerAtlasObject = false %}
    <li><a href="/categories/{{ category.slug }}/" data-category-trigger data-route="{{ category.slug }}"><span class="topic-object">{% include 'atlas-object.njk' %}</span><span class="topic-copy"><small>{{ category.label }}</small><strong>{{ category.name }}</strong><span>{{ category.description }}</span></span><span class="topic-count">{{ categoryPosts | length }}개의 기록</span><i aria-hidden="true">→</i></a></li>
    {% endfor %}
  </ol>
</div>
